## Why do we care? Prediction!

You can use the fitted model to generate predictions for yet-to-be-observed subjects:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
new_car <- tibble(
  wt = 3.5
)

predict(mpg_wt_fit, new_data = new_car)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
# A tibble: 1 × 1
  .pred
  <dbl>
1  18.6
```


